1
00:00:00,359 --> 00:00:03,239
(Leonard:)- Look, I'm no expert in women...
- I'll say.

2
00:00:05,113 --> 00:00:07,533
(Leonard:)Not necessary when
someone's trying to help you.

3
00:00:07,741 --> 00:00:11,241
(Sheldon:)Sorry, it's the alcohol talking.
Go on.

4
00:00:13,914 --> 00:00:17,964
(Leonard:)Sometimes with women
you wanna listen to what upsets them...

5
00:00:18,126 --> 00:00:22,876
...and show them that you
can grow and change.

6
00:00:23,799 --> 00:00:25,799
(Sheldon:)Nuts to that. What else you got?

7
00:00:27,886 --> 00:00:30,426
(Leonard:)I don't know what to tell you.
Buy her something.

8
00:00:32,349 --> 00:00:34,179
(Sheldon:)How does that work?

9
00:00:34,393 --> 00:00:39,443
(Leonard:)Well, you skip over any attempt
to repair your emotional connection...

10
00:00:39,606 --> 00:00:44,106
(Leonard:)...and you win back her affection
with an empty financial gesture.

11
00:00:46,071 --> 00:00:49,201
(Sheldon:)Well, that approach has
Sheldon Cooper written all over it.

12
00:00:51,326 --> 00:00:53,456
- Glad I could help.
- It's appreciated.

13
00:00:53,620 --> 00:01:00,020
If you manage to find a woman again,
I'll be glad to return the favor.

